# Run artifacts. These carry per-device data pulled off real hardware --
# the label serial (from which the stock root password derives), MAC
# addresses, rand_key/rand_nonce, 0:ART caldata and the full U-Boot
# environment -- plus, for installs, the root password hash in the
# first-boot tarball. None of it belongs in a repo.
probe-*/
install-*/
update-*/
*.log

# Release images: tens of MB, published upstream, and fetched on demand by
# release.py.
images/

# Local device dumps, wherever they land.
*.bin
*.ubi
*.itb
*.tar.gz

__pycache__/
*.pyc

.ruff_cache/
.venv/

# Working notes for this session's changes: not part of the project's own
# documentation, and not meant to be committed.
PLAN.md
